      "natural_statement": "For each fixed origin-centered rotated rectangle with R >= W >= 1 and RW <= P^(1-d), 0 < d < 1/4, independent fair conjugate choices over distinct split primes in [T,2T], T >= 5, have a nonzero rectangle witness with probability <= C exp(-c d^3 r) when d^3 r >= C0, for absolute positive constants (geometry.tex, lem:rectangle).",
